<title>UK: Cowie settles claims with former director.</title>
<headline>Cowie settles claims with former director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK leasing-to-bus company Cowie Group Plc said on Tuesday all claims by former director Neil Pykett arising out of his termination of employment had been &quot;settled fully and finally&quot; by the payment of 100,000 stg.</p>
<p>Pykett resigned in April just days before an extraordinary general meeting called specifically to remove him from his job.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
